N I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":2195,"global_rank":187470},{"name":"sambaker/nextjs-netlify-blog-template","owner":"sambaker","html_url":"https://github.com/sambaker/nextjs-netlify-blog-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"TypeScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2195,"global_rank":187474},{"name":"justinjohnso/blockchain-agreements","owner":"justinjohnso","html_url":"https://github.com/justinjohnso/blockchain-agreements","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":1,"language":"TypeScript","description":"DBX Hack Week 2021 Project","topics":[],"score":2195,"global_rank":187478},{"name":"Foozie3Moons/sails-sandbox","owner":"Foozie3Moons","html_url":"https://github.com/Foozie3Moons/sails-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2195,"global_rank":187480},{"name":"dabelt-msft/crwn-clothing","owner":"dabelt-msft","html_url":"https://github.com/dabelt-msft/crwn-clothing","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"React ecommerce","topics":[],"score":2195,"global_rank":187482},{"name":"Nickoliz/threejs","owner":"Nickoliz","html_url":"https://github.com/Nickoliz/threejs","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Working and understanding three.js","topics":[],"score":2195,"global_rank":187495},{"name":"annajiwons/foodtextapp-client","owner":"annajiwons","html_ur